  "summary": {
    "title": "Professional Summary",
    "icon": "",
    "columns": 1,
    "hidden": false,
    "keepTogether": false,
    "startOnNewPage": false,
    "content": "<p>Built the labor time model that earned Caterpillar's CEO Award, cutting $4M annually and raising warranty coverage from 16% to 95% of labor events against an 85% target. 25+ years in capital equipment engineering, from the shop floor as a mechanic and welder to enterprise machine learning. Ships production ML for predictive maintenance, forecasting, anomaly detection, and NLP on failure data, IoT telemetry, and ERP systems, with full MLOps lifecycle ownership on AWS and Snowflake. Sets standards adopted beyond the immediate team, including Amazon's fleet design life standard and dealership-wide data governance at Empire Cat.</p>"
  },
